    "detailed_description": "School simulation game 2022 edition<br><br>Achieved 1 million downloads for the entire series<br><br>A school simulator game that recreates a girls' school with cherry blossoms on a small anime-style island.<br>You control the yandere-like protagonist and attend classes, participate in club activities, buy sweets, and go to the beach.<br>You can also eat and drink at cafes, sushi restaurants, and restaurants on the beach.<br>You can also play together at the new amusement park attractions.<br><br>Club activities include a soccer club, rugby club, and basketball club.<br>You can also confess to increase your likeability.<br><br>\u30fbMethod of operation<br>(keyboard operation)<br>A: Move left<br>D: Move right<br>W: Move up<br>S: Move back<br><br>[Shift] Run<br>[Space] Jump<br>[T] Talk to people nearby<br>[F] Use the items you have<br>[Q] Pick up nearby items/Release items<br><br>[F1] Menu<br>[F2] Change clothes<br>[F3] Action<br>[F4] Fly in the sky<br><br>(Mouse operation)<br>Mouse L Click + Mouse Move: Camera Move<br><br><br>\u30fbSchool timetable<br>8:30-9:00. School attendance<br>9:00-9:40\u30001st hour<br>10:00-10:40 2nd hour<br>11:00-11:40 3rd hour<br>12:00-13:00 Lunch<br>13:00-13:40 4th hour<br>14:00-14:40 5th hour<br>15:00-15:40 6th hour<br>15:40-18:00 Club activity time<br>18:00- Return home",
